<!--
  RUST_CATHEDRAL_MECHANICS_1 §6 (the roaches — the land cleaners), owner
  addendum 2026-09-07 verbatim: "...the synthetic ones strangely tough and
  powerful. Cleaners of the area on land like the eels that live in the
  coolant rivers."

  Donor: LingLuo.Cockroach's Ling_Cockroach_Mechanoid, MEASURED 2026-09-11
  (dnfile metadata enumeration of Ling_Cockroach.dll — confirmed
  independently: exactly 5 TypeDefs in the whole assembly, no HarmonyLib
  TypeRef, no game-wide hook; a direct read of the donor's own
  1.6/Defs/Normal.xml and Patches/Core.xml, which does exactly one thing —
  PatchOperationAdd of Corpse_Ling_Cockroach_Mechanoid into
  ResurrectMediumMech's ingredient filter, donor-scoped, irrelevant here).
  Donor stats: bodySize 2, healthScale 3, armor 0.8/0.8, CompProperties_TurretGun
  -> Gun_JumpToFace (a jump-to-face melee-execution verb), custom BodyDef
  Scorcher_SixLeg.

  This is a CLONE, never a patch-in-place: the turret/jump verb, the
  ToxInBody death-bomb hediff and the RecipeDef (player-craftable mech
  gestation) are ALL dropped — nothing below references
  Ling_Cockroach.Verb_JumpToFace, Ling_Cockroach.Hediff_DeadBombToQiaoKeli,
  or Gun_JumpToFace. This is wild fauna, not a player-buildable combat mech;
  no MediumMechanoidRecipe is declared. The body is our OWN RUT_RoachHex
  BodyDef (below), NOT the donor's Scorcher_SixLeg — cloning the shape
  independently keeps this def from silently breaking if the donor mod is
  ever removed, matching "donor DLL retired from our path entirely."

  bodySize does NOT scale melee damage or armor (ceiling-fields lesson):
  shrunk to 0.22 (smaller than the organic RUT_ScarRoach's 0.25, per the
  kit spec's 0.25/0.22 split) while armor stays donor-comparable
  (0.75/0.75) and healthScale sits at a fraction that reads "strangely
  tough and powerful" for its size (1.6 — INVENTED parameter, kit spec)
  rather than being derived from the bodySize cut.

  NOT wired to RM_MapComponent_BiomeAttitude (owner ruling 2026-09-07: "leave
  the roaches out of the hum mechanics for now") — no attitude input, no
  freeze/scatter tell, enforced structurally: nothing here references that
  class, which does not exist yet regardless (a different, unbuilt section
  of this item).

  Wild-spawn wiring: mechanoid fauna presence in this campaign rides a
  SEPARATE axis from the organic wildBiomes dict — the_rust_cathedral.json
  roster's own "confidence" entry states mechanoid/Sentinel presence is
  "EXCLUDED BY DESIGN... never encoded in wild rosters" (MECHANOID_BIOME_
  PRESENCE_REVIEW_1). This def therefore carries NO <wildBiomes> entry.
  ❓ UNVERIFIED: whatever GenStep/incident already spawns the roster's
  existing mech-vermin entries (GR_Mecharat, kept in that same fauna list)
  is presumed to be the route this def rides too, but that wiring is not
  built or touched here — needs a live quicktest to confirm the roach
  actually appears on a Cathedral map, which this pass was told not to run.

  Salability: butcherProducts below yield RUT_CathedralRoachShell (a small
  tradeable resource) alongside steel on death/disassembly — salable but
  deliberately NOT "watched" by any hum/goodwill mechanic (owner ruling,
  rationale in the item file and kit spec §6): no comp counts or reports
  harvesting these.

  Art: original, generated 2026-09-12 under
  SCARROACH_CATHEDRALROACH_TEXTURES_MISSING_1 —
  Textures/Things/Pawn/Animal/RUT_CathedralRoach/RUT_CathedralRoach_{south,north,east}.png
  plus RUT_CathedralRoachCorpse_{south,north,east}.png, 512x512 RGBA, matching
  this repo's animal-sprite convention. Graphic_Multi mirrors east for west, so
  three files serve four facings. No donor art is used: the donor mod's
  textures are donor-licensed.
-->
<Defs>

  <BodyDef>
    <defName>RUT_RoachHex</defName>
    <label>roach hex-frame</label>
    <corePart>
      <def>MechanicalThoraxCanManipulate</def>
      <height>Middle</height>
      <depth>Outside</depth>
      <parts>
        <li>
          <def>MechanicalNeck</def>
          <coverage>0.10</coverage>
          <height>Top</height>
          <parts>
            <li>
              <def>MechanicalHead</def>
              <coverage>0.80</coverage>
              <groups>
                <li>HeadAttackTool</li>
              </groups>
              <parts>
                <li>
                  <def>ArtificialBrain</def>
                  <coverage>0.10</coverage>
                  <depth>Inside</depth>
                </li>
                <li>
                  <def>SightSensor</def>
                  <customLabel>left visual sensor</customLabel>
                  <coverage>0.2</coverage>
                </li>
                <li>
                  <def>SightSensor</def>
                  <customLabel>right visual sensor</customLabel>
                  <coverage>0.2</coverage>
                </li>
                <li>
                  <def>HearingSensor</def>
                  <customLabel>left auditory sensor</customLabel>
                  <coverage>0.05</coverage>
                </li>
                <li>
                  <def>HearingSensor</def>
                  <customLabel>right auditory sensor</customLabel>
                  <coverage>0.05</coverage>
                </li>
                <li>
                  <def>SmellSensor</def>
                  <coverage>0.06</coverage>
                </li>
              </parts>
            </li>
          </parts>
        </li>
        <li>
          <def>MechanicalLeg</def>
          <customLabel>front left leg</customLabel>
          <coverage>0.12</coverage>
          <height>Bottom</height>
          <parts>
            <li>
              <def>MechanicalFoot</def>
              <customLabel>front left foot</customLabel>
              <coverage>0.5</coverage>
              <groups>
                <li>FrontLeftLeg</li>
              </groups>
            </li>
          </parts>
        </li>
        <li>
          <def>MechanicalLeg</def>
          <customLabel>front right leg</customLabel>
          <coverage>0.12</coverage>
          <height>Bottom</height>
          <parts>
            <li>
              <def>MechanicalFoot</def>
              <customLabel>front right foot</customLabel>
              <coverage>0.5</coverage>
              <groups>
                <li>FrontRightLeg</li>
              </groups>
            </li>
          </parts>
        </li>
        <li>
          <def>MechanicalLeg</def>
          <customLabel>middle left leg</customLabel>
          <coverage>0.12</coverage>
          <height>Bottom</height>
          <parts>
            <li>
              <def>MechanicalFoot</def>
              <customLabel>middle left foot</customLabel>
              <coverage>0.5</coverage>
            </li>
          </parts>
        </li>
        <li>
          <def>MechanicalLeg</def>
          <customLabel>middle right leg</customLabel>
          <coverage>0.12</coverage>
          <height>Bottom</height>
          <parts>
            <li>
              <def>MechanicalFoot</def>
              <customLabel>middle right foot</customLabel>
              <coverage>0.5</coverage>
            </li>
          </parts>
        </li>
        <li>
          <def>MechanicalLeg</def>
          <customLabel>rear left leg</customLabel>
          <coverage>0.12</coverage>
          <height>Bottom</height>
          <parts>
            <li>
              <def>MechanicalFoot</def>
              <customLabel>rear left foot</customLabel>
              <coverage>0.5</coverage>
            </li>
          </parts>
        </li>
        <li>
          <def>MechanicalLeg</def>
          <customLabel>rear right leg</customLabel>
          <coverage>0.18</coverage>
          <height>Bottom</height>
          <parts>
            <li>
              <def>MechanicalFoot</def>
              <customLabel>rear right foot</customLabel>
              <coverage>0.5</coverage>
            </li>
          </parts>
        </li>
        <li>
          <def>Reactor</def>
          <coverage>0.06</coverage>
          <depth>Inside</depth>
        </li>
        <li>
          <def>FluidReprocessor</def>
          <coverage>0.04</coverage>
          <depth>Inside</depth>
        </li>
      </parts>
    </corePart>
  </BodyDef>

  <ThingDef ParentName="BaseMechanoidWalker">
    <defName>RUT_CathedralRoach</defName>
    <label>cathedral roach</label>
    <description>A small mechanoid, roach-shaped down to the twitch of its antennae, that patrols the deck plate in and near the Rust Cathedral clearing filth and scrap-waste from the ground nothing else tends. It looks fragile. It is not: strip its plating and it keeps walking, keeps cleaning, patient past any reasonable point — small, quiet, and far harder to put down than its size suggests.</description>
    <statBases>
      <ArmorRating_Blunt>0.75</ArmorRating_Blunt>
      <ArmorRating_Sharp>0.75</ArmorRating_Sharp>
      <StaggerDurationFactor>0</StaggerDurationFactor>
      <MoveSpeed>4.2</MoveSpeed>
      <BandwidthCost>3</BandwidthCost>
      <MarketValue>90</MarketValue>
    </statBases>
    <uiIconScale>0.55</uiIconScale>
    <tools>
      <li>
        <label>mandibles</label>
        <capacities>
          <li>Bite</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>6</power>
        <cooldownTime>2</cooldownTime>
        <linkedBodyPartsGroup>HeadAttackTool</linkedBodyPartsGroup>
        <ensureLinkedBodyPartsGroupAlwaysUsable>true</ensureLinkedBodyPartsGroupAlwaysUsable>
      </li>
    </tools>
    <race>
      <body>RUT_RoachHex</body>
      <baseBodySize>0.22</baseBodySize>
      <baseHealthScale>1.6</baseHealthScale>
      <!-- CATHEDRAL_ROACH_THINKTREE_GAP_1: BaseMechanoidWalker's inherited
           "Mechanoid" tree has no insertTag, so the Animal_PreMain hook
           RM_ThinkNode_EatCleanable rides never fires without this. -->
      <thinkTreeMain>RUT_ThinkTree_CathedralRoach</thinkTreeMain>
      <lifeStageAges Inherit="False">
        <li>
          <def>MechanoidFullyFormed</def>
          <minAge>0</minAge>
          <soundWounded>Pawn_Mech_Scorcher_Wounded</soundWounded>
          <soundDeath>Pawn_Mech_Scorcher_Death</soundDeath>
          <soundCall>Pawn_Mech_Scorcher_Call</soundCall>
        </li>
      </lifeStageAges>
      <mechWeightClass>Light</mechWeightClass>
    </race>
    <butcherProducts>
      <Steel>4</Steel>
      <RUT_CathedralRoachShell>1</RUT_CathedralRoachShell>
    </butcherProducts>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="RimMandrake.CreatureBehaviors.RM_EatCleanableExtension">
        <cleanableThingDefNames>
          <li>Wastepack</li>
        </cleanableThingDefNames>
        <eatsFilth>true</eatsFilth>
        <searchRadius>25</searchRadius>
        <nutritionPerMeal>0</nutritionPerMeal>
        <eatDurationTicks>5000</eatDurationTicks>
        <seekChance>0.03</seekChance>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </ThingDef>

  <PawnKindDef ParentName="BaseMechanoidKind">
    <defName>RUT_CathedralRoach</defName>
    <label>cathedral roach</label>
    <labelPlural>cathedral roaches</labelPlural>
    <race>RUT_CathedralRoach</race>
    <combatPower>60</combatPower>
    <lifeStages>
      <li>
        <bodyGraphicData>
          <texPath>Things/Pawn/Animal/RUT_CathedralRoach/RUT_CathedralRoach</texPath>
          <shaderType>CutoutWithOverlay</shaderType>
          <graphicClass>Graphic_Multi</graphicClass>
          <drawSize>0.55</drawSize>
        </bodyGraphicData>
        <corpseGraphicData>
          <texPath>Things/Pawn/Animal/RUT_CathedralRoach/RUT_CathedralRoachCorpse</texPath>
          <shaderType>CutoutWithOverlay</shaderType>
          <graphicClass>Graphic_Multi</graphicClass>
          <drawSize>0.55</drawSize>
        </corpseGraphicData>
      </li>
    </lifeStages>
  </PawnKindDef>

</Defs>
